- [Identity Security](https://docs.wiz.io/docs/cloud-entitlements-settings)    Configure scanning mode, frequency, image tag limits, age filters, pattern filters, and private base image detection for cloud-based container registries, and turn on deployed image scanning based on Sensor events.
